# Secrets and per-deployment state. Never commit these.
.env
.env.bak
generated/
backups/

# The template, however, IS the install flow: `macroctl generate-secrets` reads
# it. The repository root ignores `**/.env*` and `**/*.env.*`, which would
# otherwise swallow it — a deeper .gitignore wins, so re-include it here.
!.env.example
